{
  "about": "Planted preferences for the Big Market shopper simulator. Each segment has a context signature (what a visitor of that kind looks like to the SDK) and a winner per slot (the variant that visitor kind really prefers). Pratibimba is never told any of this; scripts/simulate.mjs only uses it to generate behaviour and, afterwards, to grade what Core learned.",
